{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"331e167bc96e31eb","type":"text","text":"# Characters","x":232,"y":-820,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"477f5fec10af127c","type":"text","text":"Werewolf\ncan't get regular metal implants because of the change\nGet bio-punk type \nable-ism? Reverse lycanthropy?\nExploration of culture of un-able-bodied people \nMissing limb?\nHairy, muscular\n\nPrevious Military propaganda before gene-therapy invented historically\nCan't get cybernetics, therefore unhire-able with Gattaca shit\n\nTrailerpark\n\nHas a birthday gift scene and you can\n- pick out a cybernetic arm - dead end (can pick left or right to fuck it up worse)\n- Can pick a chew toy, which she loves\n\nEvery time you take a day off you go see the werewolf","x":1162,"y":-644,"width":518,"height":508},
		{"id":"3a94220c7666ee8c","type":"text","text":"Vampire\n\nwod lore? (prolly not)\nCEO's personal assistant\n\nOrder \"food\" from you because they think you're cute\neat strange MRE red mealpackets\n\nFamily expects more of them and they fully buy into the corporate dream that they might one day be a CEO?","x":1240,"y":-122,"width":282,"height":322},
		{"id":"313fa931ae58eca4","type":"text","text":"Sycophantic AI\nAI and sapience / synthetic life alive\nDepressed synth who believes it isn't sapient, \nquestions of consent/ morality of acting against function\nName herself Toaster\n\nDommy/Switchy/Subby based on the users responses\n\nMaybe meet on Warehouse worker jobs\n\nFirst time you meet some body horror shit happens and they're fine with it because they don't feel ownersship of their body\n\nDoes she have genitals?","x":1200,"y":-1030,"width":500,"height":355},
		{"id":"013e982511a27945","type":"text","text":"Cybernetic Angel\nRoadside shintoist shrine maybe\naromantic\nFun and affection but not emotional intimacy\nTalks about engrams and copies and whether they're the same person, what they believe","x":1233,"y":-1317,"width":345,"height":237},
		{"id":"82eafa417bdf0c79","type":"text","text":"# Core Idea\nCyberpunk\nSapphic Visual Novel\nTranshumanist, whether moral\nSurgery and potential death\nGattaca style Augmentation\nHome Grown (individual and bodily autonomy) vs Corporate\nGod-like alien arrival a-la star trek arriving to an alien planet\n\tthey revealed they were here by accident\nDifferent nations, civilisations/cultures have different types of cultures\nFriendship =/= bad end","x":-596,"y":-1004,"width":400,"height":410},
		{"id":"5dba21ff9d59b58d","type":"text","text":"# Gameplay","x":-912,"y":-824,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"c7cb686b5c17727f","type":"text","text":"# Random Encounters  & References","x":-980,"y":-632,"width":347,"height":90},
		{"id":"ad81846477923bdb","type":"text","text":"You just so happen to burn down but company bought \n\nAnd CEO moves over to new company and nothing of value changes","x":-1069,"y":-450,"width":282,"height":208},
		{"id":"1ba27520ad3a7630","type":"text","text":"Researcher for first contact with the new god-aliens?\nCreates favoured romance plot","x":-724,"y":-1540,"width":256,"height":127},
		{"id":"36d8d606e78deac2","type":"text","text":"Side gigs to make rent?\nGig economy shit","x":-806,"y":-1329,"width":250,"height":77},
		{"id":"a1a30a281e397d0b","type":"text","text":"# Main Plot","x":-633,"y":-1113,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"152f0c77a2ab18fb","type":"text","text":"Each character revolve around a job","x":-980,"y":-1619,"width":261,"height":80},
		{"id":"0ca809e79a59796d","type":"text","text":"some that instant kill?","x":-1319,"y":-585,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1db202580457bdcd","type":"text","text":"Any Transphobia leads to instant bad ends\n\n\"Maybe you should have been a better person\"","x":-1272,"y":-784,"width":268,"height":142},
		{"id":"9af83e7cbcaf5a97","type":"text","text":"Real Choices that change things <--\nLike the character makes choices not the player,\nin-character choices\nOR \nPersonality Choices","x":-1220,"y":-1179,"width":240,"height":211},
		{"id":"adeb60bb1dde2a2d","type":"text","text":"One storyline at a time\nOR\nMultiple concurrent storylines","x":-1217,"y":-1384,"width":289,"height":132},
		{"id":"cc609a6b16e79fe9","type":"text","text":"Jenny Goldarm","x":-1388,"y":-406,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"caa7b8ebb621a4fa","type":"text","text":"Poly-web of people you can't date together","x":-1569,"y":-950,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"18aeb67231e4c82c","type":"text","text":"Dialogue tree for each character at certain point in the relationship \nwhere you go talk to everyone who you're already dating (at that point)","x":-1640,"y":-824,"width":321,"height":153},
		{"id":"30116d8a8ce378e4","type":"text","text":"Mechanic who wants to fiddle with your insides\nHelps you with transhumanist/transgender stuff?\nAromantic/Asexual\nrun in game store\nhave a short plotline?","x":-127,"y":-1142,"width":385,"height":178},
		{"id":"9a1e420a68f4de01","type":"text","text":"Corporate CEO\nHuman-pet dommy route\n\nBad Route if haven't significantly progressed certain plots?\nOr bad end if can't pay Rent first time?\n\nOnly monogomous option because no one else will date you if you pursue them","x":-106,"y":-1700,"width":364,"height":270},
		{"id":"208934e2b892d898","type":"text","text":"Cis-woman who wants a cock, and has bottom dysphoria\n\nHelp them on their journey\nLet you explore the different types of transhumanism with cyberpunk and biopunk etc","x":-85,"y":-1373,"width":321,"height":198},
		{"id":"c154a1ddba8eb116","type":"text","text":"Fellow Gig Worker\nInteract with other interesting things that you do\nReligious/Cultural ties?\nSafe Option? They're poly and they see *you* as the safe option?\nYou: \"Yeah, I mean I hang with you because you're just kinda easy\"\nThem: \"Oh, same, like you're a little boring but that's what's nice about you. Like sometimes you want to have boring sex\"\n    Them or you has a crisis\nStereotypically beautiful\nCompletely hairless\n\nBad end\nYou try become more interesting and she loses interest in you","x":320,"y":-1469,"width":403,"height":445},
		{"id":"28e143989f19e8c1","type":"text","text":"Intelligent person uploaded brain to computer and made copies of self and is now kind of everywhere\nLike adventure time Finn Mom\nAlready has multiple partners\n\nBody still alive and they want you to ","x":723,"y":-935,"width":401,"height":230},
		{"id":"8290e7549bc56d2c","type":"text","text":"# Themes","x":-931,"y":-176,"width":250,"height":69},
		{"id":"859fbd5888654909","type":"text","text":"The border between culture, religion and philosophy\nReligions and scientific philosophy\nde-centralised religion\nFully digital religion","x":-1353,"y":-218,"width":319,"height":186},
		{"id":"2b3a1c690d5f4145","type":"text","text":"Vampires\nDark and brooding\neaster egg old Vampires exist but are outclassed by the progress of society, so they just... vibe","x":-1004,"y":-32,"width":336,"height":187},
