		{"id":"b9fc6d0bc80aa365","type":"file","file":"20260925_220623.jpg","x":357,"y":-167,"width":257,"height":260},
		{"id":"eb65bb905015e51a","type":"text","text":"Get Creative Sex","x":357,"y":-298,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4d25bc7159f9e453","type":"text","text":"# History","x":-463,"y":-410,"width":250,"height":69},
		{"id":"47bd95cbebad618a","type":"text","text":"## Myconid War\n1. Myconid-Earth war because of Government want to eradicate hive-mind\n2. Myconids won overwhelmingly and just wanted legal right for people to choose to join them\n3. Definitely forced people to join during the war against consent\n- Dragons were deployed\n- Werewolves were deployed\n- \n\n","x":-596,"y":-283,"width":516,"height":329},
		{"id":"d47b46efdf683adb","type":"text","text":"God-like alien arrival a-la star trek arriving to an alien planet\n\nTheir laws see you as a lesser lifeform and for her this is actually illegal\nNo moral question here, they don't care, but you can ask why it's illegal\n\nAnd she says you aren't legally capable of consent in their culture\n\nReveals the whole big debacle on the news was a whoopsy","x":676,"y":-683,"width":322,"height":316},
		{"id":"5949efab45c03457","type":"text","text":"Cyberghost\nThey're brain got randomly uploaded to the net","x":800,"y":-1096,"width":324,"height":132},
		{"id":"a8017a06918f6140","type":"text","text":"Hacktivist Demon cosmetic modified\nActual Punk\nTalks a lot about community","x":321,"y":-1720,"width":323,"height":214},
		{"id":"37a78f9ff2b78e93","type":"text","text":"Actual sex with weird shit like whole body licking and finding weird erogenous zones","x":681,"y":-60,"width":313,"height":106},
		{"id":"92d7c8a100bf4778","type":"text","text":"Dragon/monstefucking? (backronym?)\nHarkness test morality\nHave to invent new types of sex\nGene-therapy/clone of dragon or something\nbuilt for during war, Having rights movement?\nOther characters weird about you fucking a \"monster\"\n\nYou tried to and insisted on having normal sex, please get more creative- she's kinda greatful she didn't have to break up with you\n\tOr you survive and can't afford medical bills","x":-32,"y":-669,"width":384,"height":328},
		{"id":"97e270c6365b81d8","type":"text","text":"Plant/myconid based humanoids/ship?\nMyconid hive mind religion\n\nFought a war and won, but they just wanted to hang out and give people the choice to join them\n\nPluribus Inspo","x":723,"y":-348,"width":418,"height":212},
		{"id":"e65feb66f28afaed","type":"text","text":"Can have scenes where you get them to meet if they have preconceptions and they maybe get along, maybe don't??","x":-1840,"y":-654,"width":325,"height":138}
